{"4608850":{"success":true,"data":{"type":"game","name":"Aetheris Core","steam_appid":4608850,"required_age":0,"is_free":false,"controller_support":"full","dlc":[4737250],"detailed_description":"<strong>The free demo is available now. Full-game builds include an Import Demo Save option so you can bring your demo progress forward.<\/strong><br><br>Aetheris Core is a fast-paced top-down sci-fi bullet-heaven roguelite about building a ship powerful enough to survive the chaos on screen, then proving that build against bosses that fight back.<br><br>Choose a pilot, combine attack abilities, upgrades, and relics into a focused strategy, dodge escalating patterns, and adapt to random events and Unstable Rifts where movement matters as much as damage.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Enter Unstable Rifts<\/h2>Open focused trials that compress the pressure of a full run into one to three boss-dense fights. Choose a Rift loadout, take on gauntlets and special encounters, and earn rewards for mastering challenges that bend the normal rules.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4608850\/extras\/581846b2a5bb777ba1b24953c8a25166.poster.avif?t=1793730387\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4608850\/extras\/581846b2a5bb777ba1b24953c8a25166.webm?t=1793730387\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4608850\/extras\/581846b2a5bb777ba1b24953c8a25166.mp4?t=1793730387\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Build The Run Around Your Choices<\/h2>Start with a pilot-specific ship and turn every level-up and relic pickup into a build decision. Stack attack speed, beams, area control, shields, sustain, void effects, and other synergies until a fragile starting weapon becomes a screen-clearing strategy.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4608850\/extras\/0b782f3260c8d807c2c510bb3a155cfe.poster.avif?t=1793730387\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4608850\/extras\/0b782f3260c8d807c2c510bb3a155cfe.webm?t=1793730387\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4608850\/extras\/0b782f3260c8d807c2c510bb3a155cfe.mp4?t=1793730387\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Bosses With Real Mechanics<\/h2>Face agile duelists, summoners, multi-part constructs, arena-control fights, and late-game set pieces. Read the telegraphs, adapt to phase changes, and learn each encounter instead of grinding through a raw stat wall. Your build can make you powerful, but it still has to survive the pattern.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4608850\/extras\/454aaac4658d76b7278adcecc478966a.poster.avif?t=1793730387\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4608850\/extras\/454aaac4658d76b7278adcecc478966a.webm?t=1793730387\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4608850\/extras\/454aaac4658d76b7278adcecc478966a.mp4?t=1793730387\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4608850\/extras\/4393f73896e0b04a32e88aba048f381d.avif?t=1793730387\" width=1170 height=420 \/><\/span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Hard Mode Changes The Fight<\/h2>Hard Mode remixes encounters instead of simply increasing health and damage. Expect altered behavior, tighter punish windows, new hazards, faster pressure, retaliating objectives, and variant attack patterns that demand a different solution.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4608850\/extras\/180b37e0368c951dd0c30b976fd291a4.poster.avif?t=1793730387\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4608850\/extras\/180b37e0368c951dd0c30b976fd291a4.webm?t=1793730387\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4608850\/extras\/180b37e0368c951dd0c30b976fd291a4.mp4?t=1793730387\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Random Events Change The Battlefield<\/h2>World events interrupt the usual flow with new hazards and opportunities. Adapt your movement, targets, and priorities as the battlefield changes around the build you planned.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4608850\/extras\/d784100de6c069ddb3432516ecfebdd2.avif?t=1793730387\" width=1170 height=420 \/><\/span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Pilots, Ships, And Starting Styles<\/h2>Each pilot brings a distinct ship identity, base stats, starting tools, and progression path. Lean into speed, shields, sustain, precision beams, void effects, heavy survival, or specialized multi-ability openings, then adapt the run around what you find.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4608850\/extras\/cc54551e037e2454d7a64ae59ba6fa78.avif?t=1793730387\" width=1170 height=420 \/><\/span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Grow Stronger Between Runs<\/h2>Return with Aether Seeds to unlock permanent upgrades, new pilots, more options, and cosmetic pilot and ship skins. Push deeper, master harder variants, and uncover multiple endings as the Core opens up.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Inside The Core<\/h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>Attack abilities and upgrades<\/strong> designed to combine into focused strategies<br><\/li><li><strong>50+ relics<\/strong> that redirect runs and complete powerful synergies<br><\/li><li><strong>Multi-phase bosses and Unstable Rift trials<\/strong> with mechanics to learn<br><\/li><li><strong>Hard Mode variants<\/strong> with altered behaviors, hazards, and patterns<br><\/li><li><strong>Distinct pilots and ships<\/strong> with different starting tools<br><\/li><li><strong>Permanent Core progression<\/strong> unlockable skins, and multiple endings<\/li><\/ul><br><strong>The free demo is available now. Build a run. Learn the boss. Go again.<\/strong><br><br><strong>Add Aetheris Core to your Wishlist to follow the full release.<\/strong><br><br><strong>Survive the waves. Break the bosses. Bring power back to the Aetheris Core.<\/strong><br>","about_the_game":"<strong>The free demo is available now. Full-game builds include an Import Demo Save option so you can bring your demo progress forward.<\/strong><br><br>Aetheris Core is a fast-paced top-down sci-fi bullet-heaven roguelite about building a ship powerful enough to survive the chaos on screen, then proving that build against bosses that fight back.<br><br>Choose a pilot, combine attack abilities, upgrades, and relics into a focused strategy, dodge escalating patterns, and adapt to random events and Unstable Rifts where movement matters as much as damage.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Enter Unstable Rifts<\/h2>Open focused trials that compress the pressure of a full run into one to three boss-dense fights. Choose a Rift loadout, take on gauntlets and special encounters, and earn rewards for mastering challenges that bend the normal rules.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4608850\/extras\/581846b2a5bb777ba1b24953c8a25166.poster.avif?t=1793730387\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4608850\/extras\/581846b2a5bb777ba1b24953c8a25166.webm?t=1793730387\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4608850\/extras\/581846b2a5bb777ba1b24953c8a25166.mp4?t=1793730387\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Build The Run Around Your Choices<\/h2>Start with a pilot-specific ship and turn every level-up and relic pickup into a build decision. Stack attack speed, beams, area control, shields, sustain, void effects, and other synergies until a fragile starting weapon becomes a screen-clearing strategy.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4608850\/extras\/0b782f3260c8d807c2c510bb3a155cfe.poster.avif?t=1793730387\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4608850\/extras\/0b782f3260c8d807c2c510bb3a155cfe.webm?t=1793730387\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4608850\/extras\/0b782f3260c8d807c2c510bb3a155cfe.mp4?t=1793730387\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Bosses With Real Mechanics<\/h2>Face agile duelists, summoners, multi-part constructs, arena-control fights, and late-game set pieces. Read the telegraphs, adapt to phase changes, and learn each encounter instead of grinding through a raw stat wall. Your build can make you powerful, but it still has to survive the pattern.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4608850\/extras\/454aaac4658d76b7278adcecc478966a.poster.avif?t=1793730387\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4608850\/extras\/454aaac4658d76b7278adcecc478966a.webm?t=1793730387\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4608850\/extras\/454aaac4658d76b7278adcecc478966a.mp4?t=1793730387\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4608850\/extras\/4393f73896e0b04a32e88aba048f381d.avif?t=1793730387\" width=1170 height=420 \/><\/span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Hard Mode Changes The Fight<\/h2>Hard Mode remixes encounters instead of simply increasing health and damage. Expect altered behavior, tighter punish windows, new hazards, faster pressure, retaliating objectives, and variant attack patterns that demand a different solution.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4608850\/extras\/180b37e0368c951dd0c30b976fd291a4.poster.avif?t=1793730387\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4608850\/extras\/180b37e0368c951dd0c30b976fd291a4.webm?t=1793730387\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4608850\/extras\/180b37e0368c951dd0c30b976fd291a4.mp4?t=1793730387\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Random Events Change The Battlefield<\/h2>World events interrupt the usual flow with new hazards and opportunities. Adapt your movement, targets, and priorities as the battlefield changes around the build you planned.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4608850\/extras\/d784100de6c069ddb3432516ecfebdd2.avif?t=1793730387\" width=1170 height=420 \/><\/span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Pilots, Ships, And Starting Styles<\/h2>Each pilot brings a distinct ship identity, base stats, starting tools, and progression path. Lean into speed, shields, sustain, precision beams, void effects, heavy survival, or specialized multi-ability openings, then adapt the run around what you find.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4608850\/extras\/cc54551e037e2454d7a64ae59ba6fa78.avif?t=1793730387\" width=1170 height=420 \/><\/span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Grow Stronger Between Runs<\/h2>Return with Aether Seeds to unlock permanent upgrades, new pilots, more options, and cosmetic pilot and ship skins. Push deeper, master harder variants, and uncover multiple endings as the Core opens up.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Inside The Core<\/h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>Attack abilities and upgrades<\/strong> designed to combine into focused strategies<br><\/li><li><strong>50+ relics<\/strong> that redirect runs and complete powerful synergies<br><\/li><li><strong>Multi-phase bosses and Unstable Rift trials<\/strong> with mechanics to learn<br><\/li><li><strong>Hard Mode variants<\/strong> with altered behaviors, hazards, and patterns<br><\/li><li><strong>Distinct pilots and ships<\/strong> with different starting tools<br><\/li><li><strong>Permanent Core progression<\/strong> unlockable skins, and multiple endings<\/li><\/ul><br><strong>The free demo is available now. Build a run. Learn the boss. Go again.<\/strong><br><br><strong>Add Aetheris Core to your Wishlist to follow the full release.<\/strong><br><br><strong>Survive the waves. Break the bosses. Bring power back to the Aetheris Core.<\/strong><br>","short_description":"A fast-paced top-down sci-fi bullet-heaven roguelite where you pilot distinct ships, stack abilities, upgrades, and 50+ relics into screen-clearing builds, then prove your strategy against multi-phase bosses and unstable Rift encounters.","supported_languages":"English<strong>*<\/strong>, French, Japanese, Korean, Vietnamese, Italian, German, Spanish - Spain, Portuguese - Brazil, Russian, Simplified Chinese, Turkish, Polish<br><strong>*<\/strong>languages with full audio support","header_image":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4608850\/a3df00e3bf0cb00500dde54d1a601ce7aff51bd7\/header.jpg?t=1793730387","capsule_image":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4608850\/4aaf294bece757f19239ffd2800d809a6be7f669\/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1793730387","capsule_imagev5":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/4608850\/4aaf294bece757f19239ffd2800d809a6be7f669\/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1793730387","website":null,"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:<\/strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:<\/strong> Windows 10 64-bit<br><\/li><li><strong>Processor:<\/strong> Intel Core i7-7700HQ or equivalent<br><\/li><li><strong>Memory:<\/strong> 8 GB RAM<br><\/li><li><strong>Graphics:<\/strong> NVIDIA GeForce GTX 1070 Mobile or equivalent; Vulkan support required<br><\/li><li><strong>Storage:<\/strong> 2 GB available space<br><\/li><li><strong>Additional Notes:<\/strong> Lowest tested configuration at 1920×1080.<\/li><\/ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:<\/strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:<\/strong> Windows 10\/11 64-bit<br><\/li><li><strong>Processor:<\/strong> Modern 6-core processor<br><\/li><li><strong>Memory:<\/strong> 16 GB RAM<br><\/li><li><strong>Graphics:<\/strong> Modern dedicated GPU with Vulkan 1.2 support<br><\/li><li><strong>Storage:<\/strong> 2 GB available space<\/li><\/ul>"},"mac_requirements":[],"linux_requirements":[],"developers":["Kavik St